        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35117-35132"><rb>興</rb><rt>けう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35132-35144">に乗じて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35144-35168"><rb>横臥</rb><rt>わうぐわ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35168-35186">すれば、時々</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35186-35213"><rb>笹蝨</rb><rt>ささむし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35213-35216">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35216-35231"><rb>躰</rb><rt>たい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35231-35234">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35234-35246"><rb>刺</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35246-35258">して眼を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35258-35270"><rb>覚</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35270-35285">ますあり、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35285-35312"><rb>痛痒</rb><rt>つうしやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35312-35318">頗る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35318-35339"><rb>甚</rb><rt>はなはだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35339-35351">し、之れ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35351-35366"><rb>笹</rb><rt>ささ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35366-35414">を臥床となすを以て、之に寄生せる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35414-35429"><rb>蝨</rb><rt>むし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35429-35432">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35432-35444"><rb>這</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35444-35483">ひ来れるなり、夜中吉田署長</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35483-35501"><rb>急</rb><rt>きう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35501-35513">に病み、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35513-35540"><rb>脉搏</rb><rt>みやくはく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35540-35555">迅速にして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35555-35579"><rb>発熱</rb><rt>はつねつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35579-35603">甚し、為めに頭を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-