        <p><seg source="#source-36015-36021">朝又</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36021-36039"><rb>餅</rb><rt>もち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36039-36042">を</seg><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-36063-36141"><lem><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36042-36057"><rb>炙</rb><rt>あぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36057-36063">りて</seg></lem><rdg type="base-text"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36114-36129"><rb>灸</rb><rt>あぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36129-36135">りて</seg></rdg></app><seg source="#source-36141-36150">食し、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36150-36171"><rb>荊棘</rb><rt>いばら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36171-36174">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36174-36189"><rb>開</rb><rt>ひら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36189-36204">きて山背を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36204-36219"><rb>登</rb><rt>のぼ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36219-36234">る、昨日来</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36234-36252"><rb>餅</rb><rt>もち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36252-36261">のみを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36261-36276"><rb>喫</rb><rt>きつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36276-36303">し未だ一滴の水だも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36303-36315"><rb>得</rb><rt>え</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36315-36339">ざるを以て、一行</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36339-36357"><rb>渇</rb><rt>かつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36357-36372">する事実に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36372-36393"><rb>甚</rb><rt>はなはだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36393-36408">し、梅干を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36408-36423"><rb>含</rb><rt>ふく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36423-36435">むと雖も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36435-36453"><rb>唾液</rb><rt>つば</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36453-36468"><rb>遂</rb><rt>つゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36468-36477">に出で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36477-36492"><rb>来</rb><rt>きた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36492-36525">らず、此に於て竹葉上に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36525-36549"><rb>点々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-36534-36540">てん</seg><choice source="#source-36540-36546"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36549-36567"><rb>滴</rb><rt>したた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36567-36579">れる所の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36579-36594"><rb>露</rb><rt>つゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36594-36597">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36597-36609"><rb>甞</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36609-36627">め、以て漸く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36627-36642"><rb>渇</rb><rt>かつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36642-36645">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36645-36657"><rb>慰</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36657-36678">す、吉田署長病</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36678-36705"><rb>再発</rb><rt>さいはつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36705-36708">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36708-36723"><rb>歩</rb><rt>あゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36723-36729">むに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36729-36741"><rb>堪</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36741-36750">へず、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36750-36765"><rb>遂</rb><rt>つゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36765-36789">に他の三名と共に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36789-36807"><rb>帰途</rb><rt>きと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36807-36810">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36810-36822"><rb>就</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36822-36837">かる、行者</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36837-36855"><rb>参</rb><rt>まゐ</rt></ruby><s